config MANTARAY_PROFILE_LAYER_SYNC
    bool "Automatically switch the base layer to match the active BT profile"
    default y
    depends on ZMK_BLE
    help
      Keeps the base keymap layer in sync with the active BT profile, so the
      correct layer (e.g. the Windows layer for the Windows BT profile) is
      always active immediately after boot/reconnect, not just after a
      manual layer switch.
